{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_title", "source_sha256": "0157cd586f86a130b619b6abbe33f3df6fdd99994b6a123119a16d6bbec8b080", "ja": "期待のイツザイ", "zh": "备受期待的人才", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "37768ed4ef850d79d2d1d3500b340cd22a706f38acfba859d51b0b420967780c", "ja": "スイッチのオンオフによって別人のように\n変貌する杏奈に、亜美と真美は興味津々。\n自分を受け入れて『もっちー』とあだ名も\nくれた双子に、杏奈も微笑みを返す。\n「これが杏奈だから……ありがと♪」", "zh": "杏奈会因开关的开与关而变得判若两人，这让亚美和真美充满了兴趣。\n对于接受了自己、还给自己取了“萌奇”这个昵称的双胞胎，杏奈也回以微笑。\n“这就是杏奈……谢谢你们♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "62e54db4fba122566c1d5c3f44152adc569c57f582abda85eb9a9912b95298b7", "ja": "真美、亜美は見つけちゃったよ、『イツザイ』って\nやつを……。てことで紹介しよう！　こっち来て～！", "zh": "真美和亚美发现了一个叫“逸材”的家伙哦……所以来介绍一下吧！到这边来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "660770fdd2aadaede35bfdb9bffd5353185450997d345bfa5fce8c2343a3b4ef", "ja": "あ、あの……お疲れさま、です……。\n望月杏奈、です……。", "zh": "啊，那个……辛苦了……。\n我是望月杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "2c818b83ea70173cbab74499dc9ebe52937dc2ad36ac159bae81fad67746d980", "ja": "？　杏奈ちゃんなら、真美もレッスンで会ったよ？\nあれ、でも……なんか雰囲気違くない？", "zh": "？杏奈的话，真美在练习时也见过哦？\n咦，不过……感觉气氛不太一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "b49453ebba53e99e0729ada4f5949f54fe4ca99ba9d26b188e5e3fbfc227236c", "ja": "あ、あの……\nちょっと、待ってて………。", "zh": "那、那个……\n请稍微等一下………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e26854db832dd47ee96623930b497e266048128255de4bf510884c520ba22e4", "ja": "イッエーイ！！　ビビッと参上☆\n新人の、望月杏奈です！", "zh": "耶——！！活力满满地登场☆\n我是新人望月杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "1fdb09d7af4f978501f06086780555dc019ad2c8ab0dd2bbe55492a186e82f7d", "ja": "うあうあ！？　変身したー！？\nそうだよ、真美が会ったのはこっちの子だよ！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇！？变身了——！？\n没错，真美见到的就是这个孩子哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "d5ab689ac41ef51544b7567b210cd1c9c793c63fe3d90edd1991c8c823b81b14", "ja": "杏奈、ステージの上だと思ったらスイッチが入って、\nこんな感じになるの……。紛らわしくてごめんね。", "zh": "我本来以为杏奈是在舞台上，结果一打开开关，就会变成这个样子……让你觉得混乱了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "b877dd55c611d7c60382cb69692e2555bae8255ded861154ff66f6f5d4e44a19", "ja": "でも、あの、これが杏奈だから……。", "zh": "不过，那个……这就是杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "8c84cc6df7fb56f2e17c47666cece7bb9ea7d70cab77a0013e24319db9ee242c", "ja": "ひとつぶで二度おいしい！\nめっちゃイツザイっしょ？", "zh": "一颗就能享受双重美味！\n超有才的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "fd804eee05d5094096ac94c9f82a0304c4b416beb31bb3d1923c6d710ef41199", "ja": "うんうん、真美たちは双子で二人分だけど、\n杏奈ちゃんは一人で二人分！　うらやまだよー！", "zh": "嗯嗯，真美她们虽然也是双胞胎有两个人份，\n但杏奈却是一个人就顶两个人份！好羡慕哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "f10960fa774c0fc3ed5f316fceb5a32361afa3aace918431721ed71062341df3", "ja": "……！　そ、そうかな？\nえ、えへへ、ありがと……♪", "zh": "……！　是、是吗？\n诶、嘿嘿，谢谢你……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "27a73246a8621410e4c5bcdc4de7adc1a7650e6f4c40940151bde0ba284fa766", "ja": "しかもゲームがめっちゃトクイなんだって！\n早速ひと勝負いきますか♪", "zh": "而且听说她特别擅长玩游戏！\n现在就来比一局吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "27ad2c813007dad4656c2dffee56d66147d3338abd3546377cf64e2714ac25e2", "ja": "なんと！　それはやるしかありませんな～。\nんじゃ、とりあえず呼び方決めよっか♪", "zh": "什么！那就只能来一局了呢～  \n那么，先决定一下称呼吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "c421eb4ad4888de5882ea508c32ca3069fc5ae5c634da7857bc5c12c1c914784", "ja": "うん、なんとなく決めた！\n真美も決めたっしょ？", "zh": "嗯，我就随便决定了！\n真美也决定了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area06_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "4f8c4e0ecf9cbe7203f1f10024d2a84d955dcea1882cb1b727bd4addfb00914c", "ja": "うん、決めたー！\nせーのでいくよ？　せーのっ、", "zh": "嗯，定好啦——！\n一起说哦？预备——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
